      "id": "cf051de1-4d2d-4287-8407-f1fdea93a7dc",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "The simulated call plan is ready. The shop’s stock, price, and pickup details are unconfirmed; this simulation will not place an order or make a reservation.",
